Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to your apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going to shoot an innocent film.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And I liked you the moment I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't understand what was wrong until it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,After they threw you out, I tried everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I cried, I begged, I lashed out like a madwoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I offered them money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But they didn't bat an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They tortured me for almost three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.18,0:00:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Before they finally killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The camera was on the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Until the very end I hoped you'd come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd seen in your eyes that you recognized me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.18,0:00:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the girl who sometimes looked after you when you were little.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.10,0:00:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one you trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.06,0:01:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was your first erotic fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And your only safe haven.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you standing in the hallway, hearing my screams?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.94,0:01:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you hiding out on the street?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Something held you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Something inside you fought, but couldn't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.34,0:01:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Only afterwards did you dare kiss my lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.02,0:01:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You hid my head in the holiest
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.25,0:01:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,place and gave them only my lifeless body.
